Captured from MySQL 8.0.46 and 8.4.11 Docker images, which return the same output, with schema `shop` selected:

```
EXPLAIN FORMAT=JSON SELECT t.customer_id, t.n, c.name FROM (SELECT customer_id, COUNT(*) AS n FROM orders WHERE note = 'n' GROUP BY customer_id) t JOIN customers c ON c.id = t.customer_id WHERE c.code = 'x';
SHOW WARNINGS;
```
